<div class='weather-controls' id='weather-controls'>
  <p id='weather-status' role='status'>正在获取南京天气…</p>
  <details>
    <summary>天气实验室 <span>切换效果 / 原版对比</span></summary>
    <div class='weather-panel'>
      <label for='weather-period'>时间维度</label>
      <select id='weather-period'>
        <option value='live'>跟随当地昼夜</option>
        <option value='day'>白天</option>
        <option value='night'>黑夜</option>
      </select>
      <label for='weather-scene' class='weather-label'>天气维度</label>
      <select id='weather-scene'>
        <option value='live'>当地天气</option>
        <option value='original'>原版蓝色渐变</option>
        <option value='sunny'>晴朗</option>
        <option value='cloudy'>多云</option>
        <option value='overcast'>阴天</option>
        <optgroup label='降雨'>
          <option value='drizzle'>毛毛雨</option>
          <option value='rain'>降雨</option>
          <option value='showers'>阵雨</option>
          <option value='freezing-drizzle'>冻毛毛雨</option>
          <option value='freezing-rain'>冻雨</option>
          <option value='thunderstorm'>雷雨</option>
          <option value='hail'>雷雨伴冰雹</option>
        </optgroup>
        <optgroup label='降雪'>
          <option value='snow'>降雪</option>
          <option value='snow-showers'>阵雪</option>
          <option value='snow-grains'>雪粒</option>
        </optgroup>
        <optgroup label='雾'>
          <option value='fog'>雾</option>
          <option value='rime-fog'>雾凇</option>
        </optgroup>
      </select>
      <label for='weather-intensity' class='weather-label'>降水强度</label>
      <select id='weather-intensity' disabled aria-describedby='weather-intensity-help'>
        <option value='live'>跟随实况 / 场景默认</option>
        <option value='light'>弱 · 小雨 / 小雪</option>
        <option value='moderate'>中 · 中雨 / 中雪</option>
        <option value='heavy'>强 · 大雨 / 大雪</option>
      </select>
      <p id='weather-intensity-help'>晴、云、雾无需降水强度；部分天气只有弱、强两档。</p>
      <form id='weather-city-form'>
        <label for='weather-city'>查询城市</label>
        <div class='city-row'>
          <input
            id='weather-city'
            name='city'
            placeholder='南京 / Shanghai'
            required
            maxlength='60'
          />
          <button type='submit'>查询</button>
        </div>
      </form>
      <div class='weather-actions'>
        <button type='button' id='weather-location'>使用我的位置</button>
        <label><input id='weather-motion' type='checkbox' checked /> 动态效果</label>
      </div>
      <p id='weather-notice' role='status'>预览场景为模拟效果，不代表实况。定位仅在点击后请求。</p>
      <a href='https://open-meteo.com/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer'>天气数据 · Open-Meteo</a>
    </div>
  </details>
</div>

<style>
  .weather-controls {
    width: min(100%, 370px);
    text-align: center;
    color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }
  #weather-status {
    min-height: 1.5rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
  }
  details {
    text-align: left;
  }
  summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
  summary span {
    opacity: 0.65;
    margin-left: 0.4rem;
  }
  .weather-panel {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: hsl(var(--background) / 0.94);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px #00000008;
  }
  .weather-panel > label,
  form > label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .weather-label {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }
  select,
  input[type='text'],
  input:not([type]) {
    min-width: 0;
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: hsl(var(--background));
    padding: 0.5rem 0.65rem;
    color: hsl(var(--foreground));
    font: inherit;
  }
  form {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }
  .city-row,
  .weather-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .weather-actions {
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }
  .weather-actions label {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  button {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.65rem;
    border: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    font: inherit;
  }
  button:hover {
    background: hsl(var(--muted));
  }
  button:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: wait;
  }
  select:disabled {
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
  #weather-intensity-help {
    margin: 0.45rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  #weather-notice,
  .weather-panel a {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  #weather-notice {
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
